  "notes": "Experimental simulator wing revision, 2026-09-17. NACA23012 NeuralFoil polars; span 3.5m, chords 1.65/1.35m, anhedral 3deg, washout 2deg, incidence 45deg. Original propulsion retained after alternative layout lost control in transition tests. JSBSim 115kg full takeoff/cruise/brake/hover/land completed; settled speed 97.0km/h, wing lift share 46.84%. Python engine showed lateral oscillation and lower speed, so cross-engine agreement unresolved. Not a construction or flight-qualified design. At 200kg the nose-lift sequence requests 127% available thrust. Power estimates are idealized, not electrical demand."
